  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for the Modernization of Fiscal Management of the State of Cear - PROFISCO III CE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Modernizacin de la Gestin Fiscal del Estado de Cear - PROFISCO III CE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo es contribuir a la sostenibilidad fiscal de CE, a travs de los objetivos especficos de desarrollo de: (i) mejorar la efectividad de la gestin del ingreso; y (ii) mejorar la efectividad de la gestin del gasto pblico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective is to contribute to the fiscal sustainability of CE, through the specific development objectives of: (i) improving the effectiveness of revenue management; and (ii) improving the effectiveness of public expenditure management.</narrative>
  </description>
